        },
        {
          "text": " Naarai abu kadum kama ka Ejakait, ŋun nukejaikinit yes ebe, kakuare kaya nakebilakinere ebotet, abu Ejakait Yesu kolem emugati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
